# Line endings: every text file is stored and checked out with LF, on every
# system. Without this, editors and Git's Windows defaults turned files to
# CRLF and back, and each flip showed up as a change to every line.
#
# The web page is built into the firmware byte for byte, so its line endings
# must not depend on who checked it out; LF everywhere guarantees that.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never to be converted or compared as text.
*.db binary
*.gz binary
